FixedRateIrm::setBorrowRate(uint256)
├── given caller is not the owner
│   └── when market is unset or bound and the supplied rate is invalid
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount before market queries or rate validation and preserve state
├── given caller is owner and market is unset
│   └── it should revert with IrmMarketNotSet before rate validation and preserve state
└── given caller is owner and market is bound
    ├── when supplied rate exceeds MAX_BORROW_RATE
    │   └── it should revert with IrmInvalidParams before market queries or accrual and preserve all state
    └── when supplied rate is valid
        ├── when querying the market pause status fails
        │   └── it should bubble the query revert and preserve all state
        ├── when market accounting overflows after calling back
        │   └── it should bubble arithmetic panic 0x11 and roll back both market accounting and IRM state
        ├── when market is active
        │   ├── it should query the exact PAUSE_TYPE and accrue exactly once at the old rate
        │   ├── it should add interest at the old rate to market supply and borrowed assets and update lastUpdate through the callback
        │   └── it should emit the callback IRStateUpdated then the market AccrueInterest with exact payloads before the setter events
        ├── when market is paused
        │   └── it should query the exact PAUSE_TYPE skip accrual and preserve lastUpdate
        ├── when supplied rate is zero or MAX_BORROW_RATE
        │   └── it should accept and store both inclusive boundaries
        ├── when supplied rate equals the stored rate
        │   ├── when market is active
        │   │   └── it should still accrue and emit the setter events
        │   └── when market is paused
        │       └── it should skip accrual preserve market accounting and lastUpdate and still emit exactly the two setter events
        ├── it should store the supplied rate and preserve owner and market
        └── it should emit IRStateUpdated then SetBorrowRate with exact payloads and no extra events
